From srosenfeld at nesdis.noaa.gov  Thu Aug 27 18:38:56 1998
From: srosenfeld at nesdis.noaa.gov
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 1998 13:38:56 -0500
Subject: 
Message-ID: <199808271743.NAA06809@orbit8i.nesdis.noaa.gov>

Many thanks to B.Gunter, S.Smith, S.Buttrey and especially to Rolf Turner for 
immediate help with trashing my S-stuff. Here is the most elegant solution by 
R.Turner:
Works perfect!

function()
{
# Function clean.
        lll <- objects()
        for(xxx in lll) {
                cat("remove ", xxx, "? ")
                ans <- readline()
                if(ans == "y")
                        remove(xxx)
        }
        invisible()
}

  

